Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/bbossa/keyboard_bequiet_lightmount_rgb
Description: lighting control for the be quiet! Light Mount keyboard
 Drives the per-key lighting of the be quiet! Light Mount keyboard (USB
 373f:0002) without the vendor's IO Center: fixed color zones, reapplied
 at login, on replug and after the Fn effect keys, plus short alerts on
 desktop notifications and failed shell commands.
 .
 Runs as a systemd user service. Only frames checked against captures of
 the vendor software are sent; no firmware update is ever performed.
